  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ogokora omobaro bw’ abanto na kobariika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(1 Amg 21:1-27)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omonene akaba n’endamwamu enene igoro y’Abaisraeli, agasukia enkoro ya Daudi akamoteebia, “Geenda obare Abaisraeli na Abayuda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo omorwoti agateebia Yoabu, omotang’ani bw’emegaanda yaye y’abarwani, “Bono etanana ase egati y’ebisaku bionsi bi’Abaisraeli, korwa Dani goika Beeri‐Seba, mobare abanto, erinde imanye omobaro obo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yoabu akairaneria omorwoti, “Omonene, Nyasae oo, amente abanto ara amagana atakobareka, na aye omonene one omorwoti obe moyo goika oyarore. Korende inaki ring’ana eri riakogwenera aye omonene one omorwoti?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ring’ana ri’omorwoti rikaba ne chinguru igoro ya Yoabu na abatang’ani b’abarwani. Ase igo Yoabu na abatang’ani bande bakarua ase omorwoti, bakageenda kobara Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakamboka Yorodani, bagatoora Aroeri, na korwa ase omochie oyio agwo ase egati ye rikura bakageenda Gadi, naende gochia Yeseri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bakageenda Gileadi na ase ense ya Tatimu‐Hodisi. Naende bakageenda Dani, na korwa Dani bagaetanana bagaika Sidoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakageenda Turo, omochie ore ne chindwaki, na ase emechie yonsi y’Abahivi, na ey’Abakaanani. Magega y’ayio bakageenda Beeri‐Seba ase ense y’Abayuda, ensemo ya sugusu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’emetienyi kianda na amatuko emerongo ebere, ekero baetananire ense yonsi, bakairana Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akaa omorwoti omobaro bw’abaanto abaare konyara korwana esegi nemioro. Ase Abaisraeli nigo barenge abanto chilifu amagana atan’atato (800,000), na ase Abayuda chilifu amagana atano (500,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Daudi akoorire kobara abanto, enkoro yaye ekamogaambia. Erio agateebia Omonene, “Nakorire ebibe ebinene ase aya nakorire; korende b’Omonene, nagosabire onyabere inche omosomba oo, inaki nigo nakorire egento ki’oboriri mono.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Daudi abogete mambia, ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaachera Gadi, omobani, oyorenge omoorori o Daudi, rikamotebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Geenda okwane na Daudi, omoteebie ng’a inche Omonene nigo ngoteeba iga: Nabeekire ase ore amang’ana atato; ase ayio chora erimo, eri ndagokorere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Gadi akageenda ase Daudi, akamomanyia amang’ana ayio, akamoteebia, “Nigo origetie enchara eche ase ense yao emiaka etato?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose nigo origetie otame korwa ase ababisa bao emetienyi etato? Gose nigo origetie oborwaire obobe bw’ogoita abanto bosoe ense yao amatuko atato? Bono rengereria mono na ong’e amairanerio imoirere oyio ontomete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akairaneria Gadi, “Inche nasoire ase emechando emenene. Gaki, bono, tiga togwe ase okoboko kw’Omonene, ekiagera amaabera aye n’amanene; korende ase amaboko a Mwanyabaanto tintageti ingweo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene akarentera Abaisraeli oborwaire obobe, na borobwo bogaita abanto korwa mambia goika engaki yaragetwe; abanto chilifu emerongo etan’ebere (70,000) bagakwa korwa Dani goika Beeri‐Seba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omomalaika aramborete okoboko kwaye asirie Yerusalemu, Omonene akaonchora ebirengererio biaye ase amabe ayio, agateebia omomalaika oria orenge gosiria abanto, “Bono aisanire, ororobia okoboko kwao.” Omomalaika konya oikire ang’e nekeooreri ki’Arauna Omoyebusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Daudi arooche omomalaika oria orenge goita abanto, agateebia Omonene, “Rora, ninche inde omonyabibe, ninche nakorire obobe obo, korende ching’ondi echi chiane, inki chiakorete? Okoboko kwao tiga kobe igoro y’ane, na igoro y’enyomba ya tata.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko erio Gadi akageenda ase Daudi, akamoteebia, “Imoka oagachere Omonene egesasiimero agwo ase ekeooreri ki’Arauna Omoyebusi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Daudi akaigwera amang’ana ayio Omonene achiigete goetera ase Gadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arauna agachia korigereria akarora omorwoti na abasomba baye bagotiira goocha ase are. Erio agasooka, agatung’ama inse, akaumama ase obosio bw’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arauna akamobooria, “Omonene, omorwoti one, inaki gwachire aa ase ’nde inche omosomba oo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamoiraneria, “Nigo naachire ’ngore ekeooreri kiao, inyagaachere Omonene egesasiimero aiga, erinde amaakwa atangwe korwa ase abanto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Arauna akairaneria Daudi, “omonene one omorwoti, rora kende gionsi keramogwenere ase ekeng’wanso. Ira chintang’ana echi ase ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa, na ebikorero ebi bi’okoora amo namakorogoto bibe chiinko chi’okogesambera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arauna akaa omorwoti ebinto ebio bionsi, akamoteebia, “Tiga Omonene Nyasae oo agwanchere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omorwoti akairaneria Arauna, “Yaya taibo, korende nigo ’nkobigora korwa ase ore ase rigori bikoonigwa: tinkoruera Omonene Nyasae ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa nebiinto ntagoreti ase rigori.” Igo Daudi akagora ekeooreri ekio amo ne chiombe ase chitaabu, chisekeli chi’echifeta emerongo etano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Daudi akaagachera Omonene egesasiimero, agwo akarua ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa, na eki’omorembe. Ase ayio Omonene akaigwa ogosaba gw’ense eria, na amarwaire agatangwa korwa ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
